            steps:[`The rate of change is $${C[3]}'(t) = ${k}$ ${C[1]}.`,`An antiderivative of $${C[3]}'(t)$ is $${C[3]}(t) = ${k}t$.`,`The net change is $\\int_{${a}}^{${b}} ${k}\\,dt = ${k}t\\Big|_{${a}}^{${b}} = ${k}(${b}) - ${k}(${a}) = ${val}$ ${C[4]}.`],
